  Ginseigo's voice is utterly flat, a stark contrast to her earlier tone. I feel the answer lodge in my throat.

//　無論……俺も同意だ。
//　一条が口にしたのはまさに当然の理。
  Do I㉓<I>approve?</I>㉓Of course I do. If I kill, innocents die. If Ichijo kills, only our enemies die. Why wouldn't I choose the path that leads to fewer dead?

  As Ichijo said, the choice is clear.

//　村正で敵を殺せば味方をも斬らねばならず。
