  It's as though―<K>
  As though I am on a voyage across a calm blue sea. The wind is with me, the sky is clear, the waves lap gently at the sides of my boat. Nothing can possibly go wrong.

  Yet amid that quiet, some sixth sense is warning me...<K> that from far below, a leviathan approaches.
